<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 99,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 99,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tuesday's actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog marketings were 99,000 head, compared with the estimate of 105,000, USDA said. Opening trade was not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts were steady-$0.50 per cwt higher than the midsession Tuesday.</p>
<p>				  Country		    Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    49.50 -50.50	   50.50 -51.50</p>
<p>few			49.00		    50.00</p>
<p>Sows:  mostly steady to $1.00 higher.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  40.00 -42.00	   41.50 -43.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   43.00 -45.00	   44.00 -46.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    49.00 -51.50	   50.00 -52.50</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
